\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Indonesia cbank targets 9,000 rph/$ to stem inflation\b0\par\par\uc2 508 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Januar 2011\par 11:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Cbank dep gov says \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2  market\par \par \uc2 * Cbank using 9,000 rph per dollar for inflation target\par \par \uc2 * Analyst sees cbank using \b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 , other options than rates (Updates with quotes, analyst comment)\par \par \uc2 JAKARTA, Jan 27 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stem inflation and is targeting 9,000 rupiah per dollar as a benchmark to achieve its inflation target, deputy governor Hartadi A. Sarwono said on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 A strengthening rupiah helped temper imported inflation last year but the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has slipped in January amid a sell-off in Indonesian assets as investors are worried the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be behind the curve in tackling inflation.\par \par \uc2 "If there is pressure in the rupiah, we enter the market. There, we have room to strengthen the rupiah to help stem inflation. The market reads this, that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is concerned about inflation by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market," Sarwono told reporters.\par \par \uc2 Annual inflation reached a 20-month high of 6.96 percent in December, above the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's upper end-2010 target of 6 percent, and economists are calling for rate hikes by March or April to head off inflationary pressures.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which next meets to decide policy on Feb 4, held rates at a record low 6.5 percent for all of last year.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  now has greater reserves to draw on to stabilise the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  than in past bouts of foreign investor selling, since strong inflows last year pushed \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to $96.2 billion by December, nearly double the level two years earlier.\par \par \uc2 The rupiah rose 0.12 percent to 9,022 against the dollar on Thursday, cutting losses for the year to 0.20 percent.\par \par \uc2 "If it weakens, there is a risk on the inflation target," said Eric A. Sugandi, an analyst at Standard Chartered, which forecasts the rupiah to reach 9,200 by the end of this quarter.\par \par \uc2 "This may signal that Bank Indonesia will let the rupiah strengthen to reduce pressures from imported inflation. They may prefer to use other options besides rates," he said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has repeatedly said that it sees hiking interest rates as the last resort to curb inflation, though Sarwono told Reuters last month it would not hesitate to tighten policy if core inflation neared 5 percent.\par \par \uc2 "A rate hike is the last option. But the option is open if we need it," said Sarwono.\par \par \uc2 Full year 2011 core inflation is seen at 4-5 percent and headline inflation at 6.1-6.6 percent, said Bambang PS Brodjonegoro, head of fiscal policy at the finance ministry.\par \par \uc2 This was higher than a government budget target of 5.3 percent for headline inflation and above the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's end-2011 target of 4-6 percent. (Reporting by Adriana Nina Kusuma; Writing by Aditya Suharmoko; Editing by Neil Chatterjee)\par \par \uc2 INDONESIA-ECONOMY/INFLATION (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|D|E|RBN|IF|M|RNP|DNP|PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110127e71r000vp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
